@startuml dlq-basic-flow
title <&pulse>  **DLQ no RabbitMQ** — ciclo de vida da mensagem

skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor    #D4A017

skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  BorderColor     #455A64
}

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<exchange>> #BBDEFB
  BorderColor<<exchange>>     #1565C0
  FontColor<<exchange>>       #0D47A1
  BackgroundColor<<dlx>>      #FFCC80
  BorderColor<<dlx>>          #E65100
  FontColor<<dlx>>            #BF360C
}

skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor<<main>>  #C8E6C9
  BorderColor<<main>>      #2E7D32
  FontColor<<main>>        #1B5E20
  BackgroundColor<<dlq>>   #FFCC80
  BorderColor<<dlq>>       #E65100
  FontColor<<dlq>>         #BF360C
}

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  BorderColor     #37474F
}

actor "<&account-login>\n**Producer**" as P

rectangle "<&random>\n**order.created**\n//topic exchange//" <<exchange>> as EX

queue "<&inbox>\n**inventory.reserve_stock**" <<main>> as Q

component "<&cog>\n**Consumer**\n//inventory//" as C

rectangle "<&warning>  <&random>\n**inventory.dlx**\n//topic exchange//" <<dlx>> as DLX

queue "<&warning>  <&inbox>\n**reserve_stock.dlq**\n//binding key: reserve_stock//" <<dlq>> as DLQ

actor "<&wrench>\n**Operador**\n//replay job//" as OP

P  -[#2E7D32,thickness=2]->  EX : <&envelope-closed>  publish\nrk = com.fake-ecommerce.order.created.v1
EX -[#2E7D32,thickness=2]->  Q  : route
Q  -[#2E7D32,thickness=2]->  C  : deliver

C  -[#2E7D32,thickness=2]-> Q   : <&check>  **ack** (sucesso)\n//mensagem removida//
C  -[#E65100,thickness=2]-> DLX : <&x>  **nack(requeue=false)**\n//broker reescreve rk → reserve_stock//
DLX -[#E65100,thickness=2]-> DLQ : match rk
DLQ -[#455A64,dashed,thickness=2]-> OP : inspect / replay

note right of Q
  <b><&cog> arguments</b>
  x-dead-letter-exchange       = inventory.dlx
  x-dead-letter-routing-key  = **reserve_stock**
end note

note bottom of DLX
  <b><&warning> Dead-letter dispara quando:</b>
  • nack / reject com requeue = false
  • TTL da mensagem expira
  • fila atinge x-max-length

  RabbitMQ adiciona header <b>x-death</b>
  (motivo, count, fila origem, timestamp)
end note

legend bottom right
  | <#C8E6C9> | happy path |
  | <#FFCC80> | dead-letter path |
endlegend

@enduml


@startuml dlq-without-routing-key
title <&warning>  **Sem** x-dead-letter-routing-key — todas as falhas caem numa só DLQ

skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor<<main>> #C8E6C9
  BorderColor<<main>>     #2E7D32
  BackgroundColor<<bad>>  #FFCDD2
  BorderColor<<bad>>      #C62828
  FontColor<<bad>>        #B71C1C
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<dlx>>  #FFCC80
  BorderColor<<dlx>>      #E65100
}

queue "<&inbox>\n**reserve_stock**"  <<main>> as Q1
queue "<&inbox>\n**release_stock**"  <<main>> as Q2
queue "<&inbox>\n**rebalance**"      <<main>> as Q3

rectangle "<&warning>  <&random>\n**inventory.dlx**" <<dlx>> as DLX

queue "<&warning>  <&inbox>\n**inventory.dlq**\n//binding = #//" <<bad>> as DLQ

Q1 -[#E65100]-> DLX : rk **preservada**\n(com.fake-ecommerce…)
Q2 -[#E65100]-> DLX : rk **preservada**
Q3 -[#E65100]-> DLX : rk **preservada**

DLX -[#C62828,bold]-> DLQ : binding **#** captura tudo

note right of DLQ
  <b><&x> Problema</b>
  • impossível saber a fila origem
    sem ler header x-death
  • replay manual confuso
  • monitor não diferencia origem
  • virou "lixão" de erros
end note

@enduml


@startuml dlx-pattern-service
title <&check>  **Padrão de mercado** — 1 DLX por serviço, N DLQs separadas por routing key

skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor     #FF6600
  FontColor       #BF360C
  FontStyle       bold
}
skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor<<main>> #C8E6C9
  BorderColor<<main>>     #2E7D32
  BackgroundColor<<dlq>>  #FFCC80
  BorderColor<<dlq>>      #E65100
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<dlx>>  #FFCC80
  BorderColor<<dlx>>      #E65100
  FontColor<<dlx>>        #BF360C
}

package "<&shield>  inventory service  //bounded context//" {

  queue "<&inbox>  **reserve_stock**\n//x-dlrk = reserve_stock//" <<main>> as Q1
  queue "<&inbox>  **release_stock**\n//x-dlrk = release_stock//" <<main>> as Q2
  queue "<&inbox>  **rebalance**\n//x-dlrk = rebalance//"         <<main>> as Q3

  rectangle "<&warning>  <&random>\n**inventory.dlx**" <<dlx>> as DLX

  queue "<&inbox>  reserve_stock.dlq\n//bind: reserve_stock//" <<dlq>> as DLQ1
  queue "<&inbox>  release_stock.dlq\n//bind: release_stock//" <<dlq>> as DLQ2
  queue "<&inbox>  rebalance.dlq\n//bind: rebalance//"         <<dlq>> as DLQ3

  Q1 -[#E65100]-> DLX
  Q2 -[#E65100]-> DLX
  Q3 -[#E65100]-> DLX

  DLX -[#E65100]-> DLQ1
  DLX -[#E65100]-> DLQ2
  DLX -[#E65100]-> DLQ3
}

note right of DLX
  <b><&check> Vantagens</b>
  • 1 DLX por serviço (bounded context)
  • cada fila reescreve a rk
    via x-dead-letter-routing-key
  • cada DLQ bindada pela sua rk
  → isolamento + monitor por origem
end note

@enduml


@startuml dlx-antipattern
title <&x>  **Anti-padrão** — DLX global atravessando bounded contexts

skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"

skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor     #757575
}
skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor #C8E6C9
  BorderColor     #2E7D32
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<bad>> #FFCDD2
  BorderColor<<bad>>     #C62828
  FontColor<<bad>>       #B71C1C
}
skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor<<bad>> #FFCDD2
  BorderColor<<bad>>     #C62828
  FontColor<<bad>>       #B71C1C
}

package "<&shield> inventory" {
  queue "<&inbox> reserve_stock" as Q_INV
}
package "<&shield> payment" {
  queue "<&inbox> charge" as Q_PAY
}
package "<&shield> auditoria" {
  queue "<&inbox> log_all" as Q_AUD
}

rectangle "<&warning>  <&random>\n**platform.dlx**\n//global//" <<bad>> as GDLX
queue "<&warning>  <&inbox>\n**global.dlq**" <<bad>> as GDLQ

Q_INV -[#C62828]-> GDLX
Q_PAY -[#C62828]-> GDLX
Q_AUD -[#C62828]-> GDLX
GDLX  -[#C62828]-> GDLQ

note bottom of GDLX
  <b><&x> Problemas</b>
  • quebra bounded context
  • dono da DLQ fica ambíguo
  • mistura SLAs e permissões
  • troubleshooting confuso
  • acoplamento operacional entre times
end note

@enduml
